; ============================================================================
; Phase 4 "wbrt" DRAFT - dialplan context for browser callers.
; Kept separate from [from-ata] so the ATA path is untouched.
; No Answer() before Dial: the caller must stay in "early" state so it sees
; 180/183 ringing from the office phone. "r" generates ringback tone.
; ============================================================================

[from-webrtc]
exten => 100,1,Dial(SIP/100,30,r)
 same => n,Hangup()
